<title>AUSTRALIA: CSR sells U.K. unit to Hepworth.</title>
<headline>CSR sells U.K. unit to Hepworth.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diversified industrial group CSR Ltd said on Wednesday that building materials supplier Hepworth Plc had acquired its Humes concrete pipes business in the United Kingdom.</p>
<p>CSR said it would not reveal the acquisition price for the Humes business or two United States assets which were also sold.</p>
<p>The company said earlier the three businesses were sold for a total of about A$70 million.</p>
<p>CSR spokesman Brian de Boos told Reuters that the U.S. businesses of Synkoloid and Beadex were sold to management.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
